e power planning must include grid production technology renovation goals and scales.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Referred to as 'State Grid' via '国网设备部', the organization issuing annual pre-arranged plan work requirements.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"各级政府电力规划\"<|>\"Grid production technology renovation goals and scales must be incorporated into government power planning.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造规划\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"The planning is managed uniformly by the company headquarters.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目需求管理\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Project units are organized to dynamically propose project demands based on renovation plans and operational conditions.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可研编制\"<|>\"具有相应资质的单位\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for investments over 2 million yuan must be compiled by units with corresponding qualifications.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"限上项目可研审批\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for large-scale (limit-up) projects are reviewed and approved by the company headquarters.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"限下项目可研审批\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for small-scale (limit-down) projects are reviewed and approved by branch offices based on asset ownership.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"储备库管理\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for normalizing project reserves and ensuring quality and progress meet management requirements.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"Branch offices consider operational management and project reserves to compile annual plan and budget suggestions.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"The headquarters decides and issues detailed lists of limit-up projects and investment scales for limit-down projects.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"预安排项目管理\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department initiates the compilation of pre-arranged project plans based on annual work requirements.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"Company headquarters is responsible for direct operation and maintenance asset project implementation management.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"受托方\"<|>\"For entrusted assets, the entrusted party is responsible for project implementation management while the project unit executes it.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"初步设计审查\"<|>\"设备管理部门\"<|>\"Equipment management departments organize the review and approval of preliminary designs for projects within their operation and maintenance scope.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计变更确认\"<|>\"监理\"<|>\"Design changes during project implementation require confirmation from the supervisor (engineering supervision).\")##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"grid renovation planning, project management, feasibility study, budget control, investment adjustment, implementation supervision\")<|COMPLETE|>"
