ssets under direct headquarters maintenance.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"The department participates in the review process of preliminary designs to evaluate financial aspects.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for organizing the compilation of preliminary designs and providing necessary basic materials.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"Project units commission qualified design units to create preliminary design documents based on contracts.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Design units are tasked with compiling the preliminary design documents based on approved feasibility studies and project requirements.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网经研院\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"The institute is specifically responsible for conducting reviews of preliminary design documents.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省（自治区、直辖市）经研院\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"Provincial research institutes conduct reviews for projects within their jurisdiction, including those of provincial maintenance companies.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"可行性研究报告\"<|>\"Preliminary designs must be consistent with and based on the approved feasibility study reports.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"工程造价\"<|>\"Preliminary design serves as a critical basis for controlling project costs and creating budget estimates.\")##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"State Grid Corporation\", \"preliminary design\", \"project management\", \"equipment overhaul\", \"review and approval\", \"cost control\", \"design responsibility\")<|COMPLETE|>"
