e project settlement process.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"受托运维单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Entrusted Operation and Maintenance Units are generally responsible for organizing the acceptance of commissioned operation and maintenance assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Divisions are subject to supervision and evaluation by the State Grid Equipment Department and are required to strengthen project management teams and apply information technology for project control.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2020年7月10日\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The date on which the current regulation came into effect.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造项目监理目录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An appendix listing specific grid production technology transformation projects that require supervision, categorized by type such as substation, transmission, distribution, etc.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A category of project management where emergency projects can be implemented prior to approval and reported to headquarters later, with priority given to framework agreement suppliers for service procurement.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Management rules for establishing packages of grid technology transformation projects for business expansion within investment limits, allowing for sub-project implementation upon review opinion.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目造价分析与后评价\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Processes involving the analysis of project costs after settlement and the post-evaluation of projects after operation to assess risks and improve investment management.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"国家电网公司生产技术改造工作管理规定\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department is responsible for interpreting and supervising the execution of this regulation, which replaced the previous one.\"<|>\"regulatory authority, supersession\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department conducts supervision and evaluation of Divisions through information systems and on-site inspections.\"<|>\"supervision, accountability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"财务部门\"<|>\"Project Units submit asset transfer notices and settlement reports to the Financial Department for final accounting and capitalization.\"<|>\"financial reporting, asset transfer\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"Project Units are responsible for urging Supervision Units to control project parameters and for evaluating their work.\"<|>\"oversight, performance evaluation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"Project Units oversee Construction Units as part of the multi-level acceptance process and settlement verification.\"<|>\"contractual relationship, quality control\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"During the demolition phase, Project Management Departments (acting for Project Units) transfer equipment to the Material Management Department.\"<|>\"equipment handover, disposal\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"档案管理部门\"<|>\"Project Units are required to transfer complete project archives to the Archives Management Department within three months of completion.\"<|>\"archival compliance, record keeping\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"受托运维单位\"<|>\"For commissioned O&M assets, the entrusted unit organizes acceptance, though the Project Unit may also organize it.\"<|>\"acceptance responsibility, delegation\"<|>5)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造项目监理目录\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"The list defines the specific project content types that trigger the requirement for Supervision Units.\"<|>\"categorization, regulatory trigger\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project management, grid technology transformation, supervision, financial settlement, archival management, state grid corporation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
