tment organizing audits for headquarters asset projects and guiding audit work for branches and other units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The department responsible for organizing centralized procurement activities within the headquarters' scope and guiding professional project management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The department responsible for formulating principles for its specific profession, guiding management, and handling planning and implementation for directly operated maintenance assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A branch department responsible for managing grid production technology renovation for assets within its jurisdiction, including supervision and feasibility study approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"区域审计中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"An entity responsible for organizing audits for assets within the branch's jurisdiction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A systematic process involving the renewal, improvement, and matching of existing grid production equipment and facilities using mature technologies to enhance safety, reliability, and economic performance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Large-scale projects defined by investment thresholds (e.g., 20 million yuan for primary systems) or specific types like headquarters-funded projects, requiring higher-level approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Projects falling outside the definition of 'limit-up projects,' managed with different procedural requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Emergency projects initiated due to natural disasters, force majeure, equipment damage, or critical defects requiring immediate implementation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业扩配套电网技改项目包\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A package of reserve funds established to meet business expansion needs, such as equipment capacity increase and hazard governance, decomposed into sub-projects as needed.\")##\n(\"re