    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造目标与规模\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category of goals and scale for grid production technology renovation that must be included in government-level power planning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The department responsible for organizing preliminary reviews for large-scale projects, establishing the project reserve library, managing reserve库，and coordinating annual plan and budget adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The department responsible for organizing project requirement reviews, compiling feasibility studies, supervising project implementation, managing procurement for direct operations assets, and conducting preliminary design reviews.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The corporate headquarters that reviews and approves large-scale projects, issues total control targets, makes final decisions on plans and budgets, and adjusts investment scales.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The department involved in joint decision-making procedures with the Development Planning Department regarding project adjustments and budget management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省公司设备管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The equipment management department of provincial companies responsible for managing and approving preliminary designs for delegated operation and maintenance assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A subsidiary company at the municipal level responsible for the specific implementation of delegated operation and maintenance assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The entity responsible for proposing project requirements, compiling feasibility studies or proposals, forming project management teams, and executing project milestones.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The regional branch responsible for comprehensive planning, budget control, decision-making procedures for local projects, and monitoring project progress.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家、地方、公司政策调整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Events involving major changes in national, local, or corporate policies that necessitate the implementation, suspension, or termination of equipment renovation or overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网事故、救灾抢修\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Emergency events such as grid accidents or disaster relief repairs that require immediate implementation of equipment renovation and overhaul.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"三重一大决策程序\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A specific decision-making procedure required for large-scale projects before they can be included in the branch's annual comprehensive plan and budget.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造目标与规模\"<|>\"各级政府电力规划\"<|>\"Grid production technology renovation goals and scale must be incorporated into the power planning of various levels of government.\"<|>\"integration, regulatory compliance\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目需求管理\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"Project requirements are organized and reviewed by the Production Technology Department before approval.\"<|>\"oversight, approval process\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"Large-scale projects undergo initial review jointly organized by the Development Planning Department and the Production Technology Department.\"<|>\"review coordination, governance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"Large-scale projects are reported to and approved by the corporate headquarters after initial review.\"<|>\"final approval, hierarchy\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"储备库管理\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"The Development Planning Department is responsible for establishing and managing the project reserve library.\"<|>\"management responsibility, database administration\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship)<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department compiles the draft annual plan and budget input scale suggestions based on operational needs and project reserves.\"<|>\"planning, compilation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"发展规划部\"<|>\"Annual plan and budget suggestions are submitted to the Development Planning Department for unified decision-making procedures.\"<|>\"submission, coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度计划和预算建议编制\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"Suggestions are sent to the Financial Asset Department for unified decision-making procedures.\"<|>\"coordination, financial oversight\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department is responsible for the centralized management of project implementation at the branch level.\"<|>\"supervision, central management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"省公司设备管理部门\"<|>\"Provincial company equipment departments manage the implementation of delegated operation and maintenance assets.\"<|>\"delegated management, asset oversight\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"Super high voltage companies are responsible for the specific implementation of delegated operation and maintenance assets.\"<|>\"execution, implementation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"Procurement activities for branch direct operation and maintenance assets are managed by the Production Technology Department.\"<|>\"procurement oversight, asset type\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目采购管理\"<|>\"省公司\"<|>\"Procurement activities for branch delegated operation and maintenance assets are managed by the provincial company.\"<|>\"delegated procurement, asset type\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目初步设计审查\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department organizes the review and approval of preliminary designs for direct operation and maintenance assets.\"<|>\"design review, approval\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目初步设计审查\"<|>\"省公司设备管理部门\"<|>\"Provincial company equipment departments organize the review and approval of preliminary designs for delegated operation and maintenance assets.\"<|>\"delegated design review, approval\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"政策重大调整\"<|>\