orporation of China is the overarching organization referenced in the text, issuing regulations for production technology transformation and equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"中国\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"China is the implied geographic location where national regulations and industry standards mentioned in the text apply.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"Project units organize inspections, evaluations, and assessments of design units' work and require design units to sign off on design change documents.\"<|>\"supervision, responsibility\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"Project units supervise supervision units, ensuring they establish project departments, conduct reviews, and perform daily supervision tasks; they also evaluate the performance of supervision units.\"<|>\"oversight, performance evaluation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"Project units enforce access management, safety supervision, and qualification checks on construction units, requiring them to establish project departments and meet capacity requirements.\"<|>\"safety management, compliance\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"Project units hand over dismantled equipment to material management departments for custody and disposal.\"<|>\"asset handover, logistics\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"财务资产部\"<|>\"Project units submit asset transfer notices and settlement reports to the Financial Asset Department for processing.\"<|>\"financial reporting, asset transfer\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"The Production Technology Department reports emergency projects to the State Grid Equipment Department on behalf of the Branch for directly operated assets.\"<|>\"reporting, administrative flow\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省公司\"<|>\"超高压公司\"<|>\"Super high voltage companies belong to provincial companies and provide certification materials for emergency projects managed by provincial companies