sible for controlling safety, quality, schedule, and cost for specific projects, submitting supervision data, and undergoing evaluation by project units.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Construction units are managed for safety, quality, and progress by project units, requiring strict qualification review.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"财务部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The finance department receives project settlement reports after completion acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"档案管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Archives management department receives complete sets of project archives within two months of commissioning.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Materials management department is responsible for the subsequent storage and disposal of dismantled materials transferred from project departments.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"国家\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"National level where policies may change significantly affecting equipment overhaul plans.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"地方\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Local regions where policy changes can impact project implementation.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"电网迎峰度夏（冬）\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A seasonal event involving power grid peak load during summer and winter, influencing the scale of pre-arranged project investments.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"电网事故\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Grid accidents that necessitate emergency equipment overhauls and potential plan adjustments.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"救灾抢修\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Disaster relief repair operations requiring urgent implementation of equipment overhauls.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The process of issuing annual plans and budgets, involving decision-making at the headquarters level.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"预安排项目管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The management process for pre-arranged projects, including compilation, submission, and approval.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"年度计划和预算调整\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The procedure for adjusting annual plans and budgets due to policy changes, accidents, or implementation difficulties.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"项目实施管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The phase involving direct O&M management, milestone planning, and execution oversight.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"招投标\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Bidding and tendering regulations governing project implementation to ensure mandatory bidding and efficient procurement.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"初步设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Preliminary design phase required for projects meeting specific investment thresholds or complexity criteria.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"施工图设计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Construction drawing design phase following preliminary design approval.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"竣工图文件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"As-built drawing documents compiled based on construction drawings and design change records.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"项目可研批复\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Approval of feasibility studies required before project plan issuance and for certain design phases.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"应急项目管理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Management of emergency projects recognized by official seals from relevant management departments.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"Headquarters issues investment scales to branches, which then decompose projects; headquarters also approves branch adjustment requests.\"<|>\"hierarchical authority, budget allocation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公司总部\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"Headquarters manages large-scale projects and approves adjustments requested by various units; units execute small-scale adjustments locally.\"<|>\"decision making, project oversight\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"预安排项目计划建议\"<|>\"Equipment Department initiates the compilation of pre-arranged project plan suggestions.\"<|>\"planning initiation, departmental duty\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"电网迎峰度夏（冬）\"<|>\"Branches consider peak load demands when arranging investment scales for pre-arranged projects.\"<|>\"operational requirement, resource planning\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"施工\"<|>\"Project units organize construction, supervise safety measures, and conduct multi-level acceptance checks.\"<|>\"execution, supervision\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"Project units urge supervision units to control project parameters and evaluate their performance.\"<|>\"oversight, quality control\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"Project units commission design units to compile preliminary designs and evaluate their work.\"<|>\"commissioning, design management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"受托方\"<|>\"委托方\"<|>\"The entrusted party implements assets while the entrusting party supervises the implementation.\"<|>\"delegation, supervision\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"财务部门\"<|>\"Project units submit settlement reports to the finance department for processing.\"<|>\"financial settlement, reporting\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"物资管理部门\"<|>\"Project units transfer dismantled materials to the materials management department for disposal.\"<|>\"material handling, handover\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家\"<|>\"年度计划和预算调整\"<|>\"Significant national policy changes are a trigger condition for adjusting annual plans and budgets.\"<|>\"policy influence, regulatory change\"<|>5)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网事故\"<|>\"年度计划和预算调整\"<|>\"Grid accidents are a trigger condition requiring emergency adjustments to plans and budgets.\"<|>\"emergency response, plan modification\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"年度计划和预算下达\"<|>\"Project units receive project details and investment scales issued during the annual plan and budget distribution.\"<|>\"receiving directives, project allocation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目竣工验收\"<|>\"Project units organize acceptance inspections and submit related reports.\"<|>\"completion verification, responsibility\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project management, budget allocation, operational hierarchy, emergency response, compliance, infrastructure maintenance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
