g treatment plans when passing under or through rivers.\"<|>\"crossing, infrastructure interaction\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"高落差\"<|>\"High drop is a special environmental segment that can cause adverse effects on power cables.\"<|>\"environmental stress, risk factor\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"大坡度\"<|>\"Steep slope is a special environmental segment that can cause adverse effects on power cables.\"<|>\"environmental stress, risk factor\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"高土壤热阻\"<|>\"High soil thermal resistance is a special environmental segment that can cause adverse effects on power cables.\"<|>\"environmental stress, risk factor\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"邻近热力管道\"<|>\"Proximity to heat pipes is a special environmental segment that can cause adverse effects on power cables.\"<|>\"environmental stress, risk factor\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力电缆\"<|>\"水下\"<|>\"Underwater sections are special environmental segments requiring specific technical measures for power cables.\"<|>\"environmental stress, risk factor\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"概算表及附表、附件\"<|>\"变电站技术改造工程费用汇总表\"<|>\"The summary table is a specific component included in the overall budget tables and attachments for substation renovations.\"<|>\"document hierarchy, component\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"概算表及附表、附件\"<|>\"架空线路技术改造工程费用汇总表\"<|>\"The summary table is a specific component included in the overall budget tables and attachments for overhead line renovations.\"<|>\"document hierarchy, component\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"概算表及附表、附件\"<|>\"电缆线路技术改造工程费用汇总表\"<|>\"The summary table is a specific component included in the overall budget tables and attachments for cable line renovations.\"<|>\"document hierarchy, component\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"编制原则和依据\"<|>\"电网技术改造工程预算定额\"<|>\"The budget quota serves as a foundational basis and principle for compiling project estimates.\"<|>\"regulatory basis, standard\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship