nt department for archives, responsible for supervising, guiding, and evaluating project archives and organizing acceptance for headquarters-funded projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网审计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Audit Department is responsible for organizing audits of headquarters-funded projects and guiding audit work for branches and other units.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Material Department is responsible for organizing centralized procurement activities within the headquarters' scope and guiding professional project management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Dispatch Center is responsible for formulating principles for professional grid equipment overhaul work and managing reserve, planning, and implementation for directly operated assets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"分部安质部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Branch Safety and Quality Department is responsible for managing branch-funded grid equipment overhaul work, including feasibility study reviews and supervision.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"区域审计中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Regional Audit Center is responsible for organizing audits of branch-funded projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产设备大修\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Grid production equipment major overhaul is defined as remedial work to restore assets to their original state and capability, managed on a project basis without increasing fixed asset value.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Large-scale projects are defined as those with single investments of 15 million RMB or more, funded by the headquarters, involving inter-provincial delegated O&M assets, or designated as major projects by the headquarters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"限下项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Small-scale projects are defined as all projects that do not fall under the category of large-scale projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Emergency projects are urgent projects required due to sudden events such as natural disasters,