ul into the company's overall budget.\"<|>\"budget management, financial control\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网审计部\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"State Grid Audit Department organizes audits specifically for headquarters-funded (large-scale) projects.\"<|>\"audit oversight, compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国调中心\"<|>\"电网生产设备大修\"<|>\"National Dispatch Center formulates principles and manages the reserve, planning, and implementation for professional grid equipment overhaul projects.\"<|>\"professional guidance, operational management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"应急项目\"<|>\"电网生产设备大修\"<|>\"Emergency projects are a specific classification within the broader category of grid production equipment major overhaul work.\"<|>\"project classification, urgency\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"限上项目\"<|>\"项目可研\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for large-scale projects must be organized and approved by the headquarters.\"<|>\"approval process, regulatory requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"grid equipment overhaul, project management, State Grid Corporation, budget planning, feasibility study, emergency response, regulatory compliance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
