he centralized management department for production technology renovation at the branch level, responsible for executing rules and coordinating settlements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部财务处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Finance Division of the company branch is the centralized management department for final accounts at the branch level, organizing settlements and reviewing reports.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部调控分中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Dispatch Control Sub-center of the company branch organizes settlement for directly maintained assets and assists in final account work.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公司分部审计处\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Audit Division of the company branch organizes audit work for asset-related project final accounts at the branch level.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位运检部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The operation and maintenance departments of various units are the centralized management departments for production technology renovation at the unit level, responsible for executing rules and coordinating settlements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位财务部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The finance departments of various units are the centralized management departments for final accounts at the unit level, organizing settlements and reviewing reports.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位安质、信通、物资、调度部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"These departments at various units organize settlement for directly maintained assets according to professional divisions and assist in final account work.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"各单位审计部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The audit departments of various units organize audit work for asset-related project final accounts.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Construction units are responsible for compiling project final settlement books within 15 or 20 days after project completion and acceptance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for submitting settlement materials to finance departments, organizing final account report compilation, and performing accounting adjustments based on approval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设计单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Design units cooperate in compiling corresponding project settlement materials and provide design documents as part of the settlement basis.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监理单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Supervision units cooperate in compiling settlement materials and provide supervision summary reports as part of the final account basis.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"咨询单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Consulting units cooperate in compiling settlement materials and provide services related to project costs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术改造项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Production technology renovation projects are the subject of these regulations, involving construction, equipment purchase, and management activities requiring final account processing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工决算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Final account refers to the activity of settling all costs incurred throughout the project lifecycle (design, construction, equipment, etc.) and reflects investment, progress, and financial status.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"竣工结算\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Final settlement refers to the process of settling specific costs based on contracts after project completion, serving as a prerequisite for the final account.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"固定资产\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Fixed assets are the category of value being verified and registered based on the accurate analysis and allocation of expenses in the final account report.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"中华人民共和国法律\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"National laws and regulations of the People's Republic of China serve as the legal basis for formulating these management regulations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"生产技术改造项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation establishes regulations specifically to manage production technology renovation projects and their final accounts.\"<|>\"regulatory authority, project scope\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation assigns the role of centralized management for production technology renovation projects to the Operation and Maintenance Department.\"<|>\"organizational hierarchy, responsibility assignment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation assigns the role of centralized management for final accounts to the Finance Department.\"<|>\"organizational hierarchy, responsibility assignment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"生产技术改造项目\"<|>\"The Operation and Maintenance Department is the primary manager responsible for overseeing production technology renovation projects.\"<|>\"management oversight, operational control\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"竣工决算\"<|>\"The Finance Department is the central body responsible for organizing, coordinating, and auditing the final account process.\"<|>\"financial management, reporting authority\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网安质部\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The Safety and Quality Department cooperates with the Operation and Maintenance Department by organizing specific asset settlements and assisting in final account work.\"<|>\"departmental cooperation, functional support\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"审计部\"<|>\"国网财务部\"<|>\"The Audit Department supports the Finance Department by conducting audits on headquarters asset-related project final accounts.\"<|>\"audit function, financial compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"施工单位\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"Construction units submit settlement books to the project unit for review and processing.\"<|>\"contractual relationship, workflow dependency\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"竣工决算\"<|>\"Project units are responsible for organizing the compilation of the final account report and submitting it for audit.\"<|>\"responsibility, execution\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"竣工结算\"<|>\"Project units receive settlement materials from construction/design/supervision units and transfer them to finance departments to complete settlement.\"<|>\"process coordination, handover\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"竣工决算\"<|>\"固定资产\"<|>\"The final account report serves as the basis for correctly registering fixed assets.\"<|>\"asset verification, financial recording\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术改造项目\"<|>\"竣工决算\"<|>\"Production technology renovation projects undergo the final account process to settle all costs and verify investment.\"<|>\"project lifecycle, financial closure\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"State Grid Corporation, production technology renovation, final account management, settlement procedures, organizational responsibilities, audit requirements, fixed assets\")<|COMPLETE|>"
