es, economics, and disposal plans.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目建议书模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A template listed in the attachments for project proposals.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研评审需求表模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A template listed in the attachments for project feasibility study review requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研评审会议记录模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A template listed in the attachments for recording project feasibility study review meetings.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研评审意见模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A template listed in the attachments for project feasibility study review opinions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目可研批复意见模板\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A template listed in the attachments for project feasibility study approval opinions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category of projects involving technical transformation of power grid production systems, the quality of which is evaluated alongside major equipment overhauls.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"设备大修\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A category of projects involving major overhauls of equipment, evaluated alongside technical transformations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"输电项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A specific type of project focusing on transmission lines, requiring detailed descriptions of line length, tower types, and conductor specifications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"变电项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A specific type of project focusing on substations, requiring details on main transformer capacity, wiring types, and equipment selection.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"配电项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A specific type of project focusing on distribution networks, requiring details on line lengths, transformer counts, and capacities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"二次项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A specific type of project focusing on secondary equipment, requiring descriptions of operating status and communication network structures if applicable.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产建筑物项目\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A specific type of project focusing on production buildings, requiring details on area, structure, height, and operational status.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各级设备管理部门\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Various equipment management departments are responsible for reviewing and approving project feasibility studies according to their authority.\"<|>\"approval authority, supervision\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各单位\"<|>\"所属单位\"<|>\"Units can approve feasibility studies for their subordinate units, but subordinate units are restricted from cross-level approvals.\"<|>\"hierarchical authority, approval restriction\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目单位\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Project units are required to ensure the quality of the feasibility study compilation and cooperate with the approval process.\"<|>\"quality assurance, cooperation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各级经研院（所）\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Research institutes are responsible for conducting the reviews of project feasibility studies and ensuring high quality and timeliness.\"<|>\"review duty, performance assessment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网设备部\"<|>\"本规定\"<|>\"The State Grid Equipment Department is designated to interpret and supervise the execution of this regulation.\"<|>\"interpretation, supervision\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司生产技术改造和设备大修项目可研编制与审批管理规定\"<|>\"本规定\"<|>\"The previous regulation is explicitly abolished and replaced by the current regulation.\"<|>\"regulation replacement, abolition\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目可行性研究报告模板\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"The template provides the standardized structure and content requirements for compiling a project feasibility study report.\"<|>\"documentation standard, compilation guide\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"输电项目\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for transmission projects require specific technical details regarding lines, towers, and conductors.\"<|>\"technical specification, project type\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"变电项目\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for substation projects require specific details on transformers, wiring, and equipment selection.\"<|>\"technical specification, project type\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"配电项目\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for distribution projects require specific details on lines and transformers.\"<|>\"technical specification, project type\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"二次项目\"<|>\"项目可行性研究\"<|>\"Feasibility studies for secondary projects require details on secondary equipment and communication networks.\"<|>\"technical specification, project type\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project feasibility study\", \"approval process\", \"equipment management\", \"state grid corporation\", \"technical transformation\", \"major overhaul\", \"regulatory compliance\", \"evaluation criteria\")<|COMPLETE|>"
