    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The organization issuing management regulations for grid production technology transformation, equipment overhaul, and feasibility study compilation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The organization that publishes grid technology renovation quotas and grid demolition engineering quotas used as the primary selection standard.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造和设备大修项目估算编制指导意见\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A guidance document issued in 2021 to direct the compilation of estimates for grid production technology transformation and major equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定（2020年版）\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A regulation implemented on July 1, 2021, serving as a basis for cost calculation and quota standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网技术改造工程预算编制与计算规定(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A regulation listed as a basis for compiling budget estimates for grid technology renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网检修工程预算编制与计算规定(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A regulation listed as a basis for compiling budget estimates for grid maintenance engineering projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网技术改造工程概算定额(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A quota standard used for preliminary estimates in grid technology renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网技术改造工程预算定额(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A quota standard used for detailed budget estimates in grid technology renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网拆除工程预算定额(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A quota standard used for budget estimates regarding grid demolition projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网检修工程预算定额(2020年版)\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A quota standard used for budget estimates regarding grid maintenance projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程概预算定额价格水平调整办法\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A method for adjusting price levels of quotas for grid technology renovation and maintenance projects from the 2020 edition.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司电网生产技术改造工作管理规定\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A management re