ard\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家发展改革委员会\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"The commission's notice on relaxing professional service prices serves as the basis for the guidelines executed by the China Electricity Council for these projects.\"<|>\"regulatory basis, price relaxation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"财政部国家税务总局海关总署\"<|>\"增值税\"<|>\"This joint body issued the specific announcement (2019 No. 39) that governs the implementation of VAT tax rates.\"<|>\"policy issuance, tax regulation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力工程造价与定额管理总站\"<|>\"人工费\"<|>\"The station publishes the regulations used to calculate labor price differences and adjustment coefficients.\"<|>\"regulation publication, cost calculation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定\"<|>\"2015年版\"<|>\"The 2020 version is an update to the 2015 version, introducing changes in scope, terminology, fees, and manual labor prices.\"<|>\"version update, regulatory evolution\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定\"<|>\"应急改造工程\"<|>\"The 2020 version introduces new terms and fee calculations specifically for emergency renovation projects.\"<|>\"new category inclusion, fee structure addition\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定\"<|>\"人工费\"<|>\"The 2020 version significantly increases the manual price levels compared to the 2015 version, as detailed in Table 1-1.\"<|>\"price adjustment, labor cost increase\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定\"<|>\"配网工程\"<|>\"The 2020 version reclassifies 20kV and below distribution network projects into a distinct category with further subdivisions.\"<|>\"project classification, structural change\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"自主实施项目\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"Autonomous implementation projects are defined as a subset or specific type of grid technical transformation and major overhaul projects.\"<|>\"project definition, subset relationship\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"建筑安装工程费\"<|>\"人工费\"<|>\"In the 2020 version, the calculation base for construction and installation fees changed to include both labor fees and machinery fees.\"<|>\"calculation base, fee composition\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"grid technical transformation\", \"power grid overhaul\", \"fee calculation regulations\", \"quota updates\", \"VAT reform\", \"labor price adjustment\", \"emergency renovation\", \"autonomous implementation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
