    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"中国电力企业联合会\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"An organization that published the \"Notice on Implementing <State Development and Reform Commission Notice on Further Relaxing Professional Service Prices for Construction Projects>发改价格 ([2015] 299 No.)\" guidelines.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家发展改革委员会\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A government body that issued the notice regarding further relaxing professional service prices for construction projects, referenced in document [2015] 299.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财政部国家税务总局海关总署\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Jointly issued the \"Announcement on Deepening VAT Reform Policies\" (2019 No. 39) governing VAT tax rates.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力工程造价与定额管理总站\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The organization responsible for publishing regulations on calculating labor, material, and construction machinery price differences for compilation base periods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网生产技术改造和设备大修项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Projects involving technical transformation and major overhauls of power grid production technology, subject to specific fee calculation and execution rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自主实施项目\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Technical transformation and major overhaul projects where the owner undertakes part or all of the construction tasks independently, with specific estimation and settlement principles.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"应急改造工程\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A newly added category of engineering events in the 2020 version, including specific fees like emergency dispatch, coordination, and safety measures.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2020年版电网技术改造及检修工程定额和费用计算规定\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The updated set of regulations and quotas for grid technical transformation and maintenance engineering, effective from the date of release, replacing or updating the 2015 version.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"增值税\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A tax category governed by the announcement (2019 No. 39), requiring equipment and materials to be listed with both taxable and non-taxable prices.\")##\n(\"entity\"<