    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation of China is the organization issuing the regulations for production technology transformation and equipment overhaul project archives. It has a headquarters, branches, provincial companies, and affiliated units like Guowang Xinyuan and Guowang Yundong.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网办公厅\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The General Office of State Grid Corporation serves as the central management department for project archives at the headquarters level, responsible for unified management, supervision, guidance, and evaluation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Operations and Maintenance Department of State Grid Corporation is responsible for leading and coordinating file archiving work, guiding subordinate units, and organizing archive acceptance and transfer processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Finance Department is responsible for providing relevant financial documents for projects and cooperating with project management departments to complete archive transfers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"审计部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Audit Department provides relevant audit documents for projects and cooperates with project management departments to complete archive transfers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Material Department organizes the collection and sorting of documents related to procurement (including bidding) during the design, supervision, and construction phases, and confirms contract information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省公司级单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial-level company units are responsible for implementing the regulations, managing their own project archives through their offices and operations and maintenance departments, and supervising local projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"地市公司级单位\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"City-level company units manage project archives locally, including receiving, storing, and utilizing files, and verifying the authenticity and completeness of documents from construction participants.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网新源公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A directly affiliated unit of State Grid Corporation subject to these project archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网运行公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A directly affiliated unit of State Grid Corporation subject to these project archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网信通公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A directly affiliated unit of State Grid Corporation subject to these project archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"中华人民共和国档案法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A national law cited as a basis for formulating the archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家重大建设项目文件归档要求与档案整理规范\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standard (DA/T28-2002) cited as a basis for the archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"科学技术档案案卷构成的一般要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standard (GB/T11822-2008) cited regarding the quality requirements for archive files and volumes.\")##\n(\"entity)<|>\"电子文件归档与管理规范\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A standard (GB/T 18894-2002) cited regarding the requirements for archiving electronic files.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目档案管理归档范围目录表\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An attachment document listing the scope of files to be archived for production technology transformation and equipment overhaul projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"2018年4月10日\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The date on which the regulation came into effect.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网办公厅\"<|>\"The General Office of State Grid Corporation acts as the central management department for the archives of State Grid Corporation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The Operations and Maintenance Department leads and coordinates the file archiving work for State Grid Corporation.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"财务部\"<|>\"The Finance Department provides necessary financial documents for State Grid Corporation's projects.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"物资部\"<|>\"The Material Department collects and sorts procurement-related documents for State Grid Corporation's projects.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"省公司级单位\"<|>\"Provincial-level units implement the regulations and manage their own archives under the guidance of the headquarters.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"地市公司级单位\"<|>\"City-level units manage local project archives and verify documents from construction participants according to the regulations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网新源公司\"<|>\"Guowang Xinyuan Company is an affiliated unit that must comply with the project archive management regulations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"中华人民共和国档案法\"<|>\"The regulations are formulated based on the provisions of the Archives Law of the People's Republic of China.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"科学技术档案案卷构成的一般要求\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目档案管理归档范围目录表\"<|>\"Both are standards/documents referenced in the text to define the scope and quality of project archives.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"2018年4月10日\"<|>\"The Operations and Maintenance Department is responsible for interpreting and supervising the execution of the regulation effective on this date.\")##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"State Grid Corporation\", \"project archive management\", \"production technology transformation\", \"equipment overhaul\", \"archiving standards\", \"organizational responsibilities\")<|COMPLETE|>"
