ering projects, which have specific requirements for preliminary design content depth including path selection, weather conditions, and tower types.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电缆工程\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Cable engineering projects, which have specific requirements for preliminary design content depth including cable selection, laying methods, and communication optical cables.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省电力公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial electric power companies, identified in the management flow chart as relevant departments or units involved in the project approval and review process.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"地市：县供电公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"City and county power supply companies, identified in the management flow chart as relevant departments involved in the project process.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"国网运检部\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation delegated the authority to interpret and supervise the execution of the regulations to its Operations and Maintenance Department.\"<|>\"organizational structure, supervision duty\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"生产技改和设备大修项目初设编制及评审管理流程\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation established and manages the workflow for preliminary design compilation and review of its projects.\"<|>\"policy creation, operational workflow\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网公司\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目初设编制深度规定\"<|>\"The State Grid Corporation published the regulations defining the depth requirements for preliminary designs of its projects.\"<|>\"regulatory authority, technical standards\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"2014年8月1日\"<|>\"国家电网生〔2010〕1761号\"<|>\"The regulation numbered 1761 was officially abolished on this date when the new rules took effect.\"<|>\"legal status change, replacement\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技术改造和设备大修项目初设编制深度规定\"<|>\"Q/GDW383-2009\"<|>\"The depth regulation cites the Q/GDW383-2009 standard as a normative reference for intelligent substation design.\"<|>\"technical reference, compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\